            "datePublished": "30 Oct 2014 00:00:00 GMT",
            "about": "I'm guilty of being a very sad person most of the time and I've struggled to try and be happy for most of my life. I'm lucky to be able to say that many of my friends help remind me to be happier every day, but I rarely give that back to anyone. I wrote this collection of songs for some of my close friends and acquaintances because it's the only thing I know how to do, though I'm not very talented. I just want to say thank you to all of my friends and family, and I hope to help make them all happy someday.\nI've always wanted to write electronic music for a video game so a lot of my inspiration for this project came from various soundtracks I've listened to. I'm sure it comes through pretty well that I wrote a lot of this material as if these songs were character themes for a fantasy role playing game.",
            "credits": "released October 30, 2014\nA special thanks is in order for all the people who helped inspire these songs; you know who you are.",
